        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Rect">Rect</ref> 5.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">On suman landum gebyreð mare gafol|ræden.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">In some estates it is custom that a greater tax [is] due.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">[5.1] Mid us is geræd, þæt he sylle V sustras huniges to gafole; on suman landum gebyreð mare gafolræden.</ab>
